From: shkosugi <sin.kosugi@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 23:15:10 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 34/37] System.Drawing.Common: dotnet/runtime release/6.0's
 source, as it is

The last System.Drawing.Common with a Linux implementation (.NET 7 made it Windows only):
dotnet/runtime (MIT) src/libraries/System.Drawing.Common/src at 76b96800a40e (release/6.0,
2024-11-15), with the files of src/libraries/Common/src it links (under Common\). Its project is
kept as System.Drawing.Common.csproj.original, the list of its sources for the next commit's.

Unchanged here: the next commits build it in the fork and change it, each change under #if
WebFormsForCore or in Core\.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
